# Sample Documents .gitignore

# Exclude binary document files from version control to prevent repository bloat
# These files should be downloaded separately from the secure document storage
# See README.md for instructions on how to obtain test documents

# Document files
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
*.tif
*.TIF
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG

# Exceptions - Always include these files
!README.md
!**/README.md
!*.json
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!*.xml
!*.properties

# Instructions for obtaining test documents:
# 1. Access the secure document storage at s3://mca-documents-{environment}/test-documents/
# 2. Download the required test documents to this directory
# 3. Maintain the same directory structure as defined in metadata.json
# 4. Do not commit these binary files to the repository